<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-GENERALI OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GENERALI OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KITZBUEHEL, Austria 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $535,000 Generali Open men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix denotes seeds):</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>2-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat 16-Renzo Furlan (Italy) 7-6 (7-5) 6-7 (2-7) 6-1</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>15-Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) beat 9-Marcelo Fillipini</p>
<p>(Uruguay) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Julian Alonso (Spain) beat Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 4-6 6-3 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5)</p>
<p>10-Filip Dewulf (Belgium) beat 2-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia)</p>
<p>7-5 7-5</p>
<p>14-Galo Blanco (Spain) beat Stefan Koubek (Austria) 6-7 (6-8)</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
